WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.684 --> 00:00:12.184
Two days before the lunch, President Trump described SI as a two-way race. “It's just us and China,” he said.

2
00:00:12.781 --> 00:00:17.004
In his estimate, America is about a year, maybe a year and a

3
00:00:17.004 --> 00:00:18.264
half, ahead.

4
00:00:18.804 --> 00:00:24.824
Others have put the gap at months, not years. Claims like these are hard to verify.

5
00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:30.984
Washington increasingly treats advanced SI as strategic, not just as a product.

6
00:00:31.261 --> 00:00:35.364
It touches economic strength, scientific discovery and national

7
00:00:35.364 --> 00:00:36.424
security.

8
00:00:36.644 --> 00:00:43.784
And it depends on things a country has to build: chips, factories, power plants and data centers.

9
00:00:44.004 --> 00:00:55.064
Days before the lunch, China's President Xi Jinping visited the White House. The two countries agreed to open a channel for SI safety incidents, with talks planned for November.

10
00:00:55.364 --> 00:00:59.544
Competition and conversation, at the same time.
